{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-005", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -1.0, "keywords": ["loss"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Oxford PV achieves 25.6% efficiency for perovskite-silicon tandem module based on shingled design", "content": "<p>Oxford PV reported a 25.6% efficiency for a perovskite–silicon tandem module using Fraunhofer ISE’s Matrix Shingle architecture, marking the first successful integration of both technologies. The shingled, busbar-free design reduces resistive and shading losses while improving energy yield, durability, and module-level performance.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/oxford-pv-achieves-25-6-efficiency-for-perovskite-silicon-tandem-module-based-on-shingled-design/\">", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/oxford-pv-achieves-25-6-efficiency-for-perovskite-silicon-tandem-module-based-on-shingled-design/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-006", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Scatec starts building 120 MW of solar in Tunisia", "content": "<p>Construction of the 120 MW Sidi Bouzid II solar plant in Tunisia is now underway after the €96 million ($110.1 million) project reached financial close.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/scatec-starts-building-120-mw-of-solar-in-tunisia/\">Scatec starts building 120 MW of solar in Tunisia</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/scatec-starts-building-120-mw-of-solar-in-tunisia/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-007", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "GameChange Energy integrates platforms to simplify utility-scale solar", "content": "<p>Managing multiple suppliers across trackers, eBOS, transformers, and O&#38;M adds cost and risk to every utility-scale project. A more integrated approach from manufacturers – most recently, GameChange Energy – streamlines both procurement and construction, reducing risk for developers and EPCs, according to the company’s CEO, Phillip Vyhanek.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/gamechange-energy-integrates-platforms-to-simplify-utility-scale-solar/\">GameChange Ene", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/gamechange-energy-integrates-platforms-to-simplify-utility-scale-solar/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-008", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Mongolia tenders 110 MW of solar", "content": "<p>A tender is open in Mongolia for the development of 110 MW of solar tied to 52 MW/188 MWh of battery energy storage across five different sites. The deadline for expressions of interest is August 16.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/mongolia-tenders-110-mw-of-solar/\">Mongolia tenders 110 MW of solar</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/mongolia-tenders-110-mw-of-solar/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-009", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Argentina advances 232 battery bids in AlmaSADI tender", "content": "<p>Argentina has cleared 232 of 235 bids totaling 8.3 GW to proceed in its AlmaSADI storage tender, after proposals exceeded the scheme’s 700 MW reference target by almost 12 times. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/argentina-advances-232-battery-bids-in-almasadi-tender/\">Argentina advances 232 battery bids in AlmaSADI tender</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/argentina-advances-232-battery-bids-in-almasadi-tender/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-010", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Portugal plans capacity market with dedicated battery storage auction", "content": "<p>Portugal is developing a capacity market open to batteries, power plants and flexible demand, and has reaffirmed plans to auction 750 MVA of battery storage capacity. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/portugal-plans-capacity-market-with-dedicated-battery-storage-auction/\">Portugal plans capacity market with dedicated battery storage auction</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/portugal-plans-capacity-market-with-dedicated-battery-storage-auction/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-011", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "IPVF, TU Delft achieve 31% efficiency for 4 cm2 perovskite-silicon tandem solar cell", "content": "<p>Researchers from IPVF and TU Delft have achieved 31% efficiency on a 4 cm² two-terminal perovskite-silicon tandem solar cell using nanotextured silicon heterojunction bottom cells and ambient-air slot-die coated perovskite layers.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/ipvf-tu-delft-achieve-31-efficiency-for-4-cm2-perovskite-silicon-tandem-solar-cell/\">IPVF, TU Delft achieve 31% efficiency for 4 cm2 perovskite-silicon tandem solar cell</a> appeared first on <a href=\"h", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/ipvf-tu-delft-achieve-31-efficiency-for-4-cm2-perovskite-silicon-tandem-solar-cell/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-012", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "PV module recycling tech based on heavy liquid separation, metal chloride etching", "content": "<p>Researchers in China have developed a three-step recycling process for end-of-life crystalline silicon PV modules that recovers high-purity silicon, copper, silver compounds, and other valuable materials while enabling reagent reuse. Life cycle and techno-economic analyses showed the process can cut carbon emissions by 80.42% compared with conventional methods and generate positive returns from solar-cell and solder-strip treatment stages.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/pv-module-recycling-tech-based-on-heavy-liquid-separation-metal-chloride-etching/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-18-013", "date": "2026-06-18", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Europe foresees 20% rise in power demand driven by electrification", "content": "<p>EU planning scenarios show electricity demand rising sharply toward 2050 as electrification accelerates, with battery storage emerging as a key flexibility and system-balancing technology alongside hydrogen. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/europe-foresees-20-rise-in-power-demand-driven-by-electrification/\">Europe foresees 20% rise in power demand driven by electrification</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/18/europe-foresees-20-rise-in-power-demand-driven-by-electrification/", "type": "rss"}]}
